<title>UK: SocGen sets warrants on Ciba Speciality.</title>
<headline>SocGen sets warrants on Ciba Speciality.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGA Societe Generale Acceptance Nv has issued one million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Ciba Speciality Chemicals Inc, lead manager Societe Generale Bank and Trust, Zurich said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by one warrant.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    145 CHF		   PREMIUM	15.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     13.85 CHF		 GEARING	9.93 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.MAY.98		 PAYDATE	04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  137.50 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
